  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "If a critical alert arrives at 16:50 and the operative arrives at 18:10, attendance is 80 elapsed minutes. It is not measured from the next business day. A separate routine request received at the same time follows the routine window.",
